<title>FINLAND: Finnish central bank confirms markka-ERM link.</title>
<headline>Finnish central bank confirms markka-ERM link.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland on Saturday confirmed Finland would join Europe's exchange rate mechanism on October 14  SPFD.</p>
<p>In a statement, it said the markka's central rate was set at FIM 5.80661 per ECU. &quot;For instance, the corresponding central rate against the Deutschemark is FIM 3.0400,&quot; the central bank said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0247</p>
</text>
